### sourcing the null device in sh
#!/bin/sh
source /dev/null
>>> SC3046 2:1
>>> SC3051 2:1

### sourcing the null device in dash
#!/bin/dash
source /dev/null
>>> SC3046 2:1
>>> SC3051 2:1

### sourcing the null device in busybox is fine
#!/bin/busybox sh
# shellcheck shell=busybox
source /dev/null
>>> none
